Subject: [PATCH] fix(plans): a plan adding exactly the people the owner's line
 named is refused and they are asked (3928 re-run)
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Box 49146 (conv 48289, 0 of 1 with e4d7922): „კარგი ელექტრიკოსი მჭირდება
საბურთალოზე, ჰკითხე ლაშა მილიძეს და დათო ტრუბაძეს." got a plan naming the
same two and „დავიწყო?" — the owner-instruction refusal only fired when a
plan added exactly ONE person, so 0024's two-person send never ran.

The refusal now fires when the plan adds exactly the people the
instruction names, each one saved contact (contactsNamed, phones compared
by digits); one person keeps the original reading. The refusal then sends
to all of them (0024).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01HwFREQwL5g9E6qRrUf9bau
